message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Data and documentation are CC BY 4.0, code is MIT."
title: "ctcae-lab-validation: validation dataset for CTCAE laboratory grading implementations"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - name: "ctcae-lab-validation contributors"
keywords:
  - CTCAE
  - laboratory toxicity grading
  - validation dataset
  - CDISC
  - SDTM
  - ADaM
abstract: >-
  Vendor-neutral validation records for implementations of CTCAE v5.0 and v6.0 laboratory grading: one record at,
  one step above and one step below every laboratory threshold of both versions, with the expected grade and term
  of each version, the criteria rules exercised and the reading conventions relied on. Includes a machine-readable
  transcription of the CTCAE laboratory criteria with verbatim wording, CDISC test codes, SI and conventional
  views, and reference comparators for SAS and R.
